---
// KeyTopics component - displays the four main conference topics
---

<section id="themes" class="py-32 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-20">
            <div class="inline-block">
                <h2
                    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display font-bold text-dark-900 mb-4 tracking-tight"
                >
                    Key Topics: Ruby and Startups
                </h2>
                <div
                    class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-ruby-500 to-pink-500 rounded-full mx-auto"
                >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-6"
            >
                <div class="w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                    <img
                        src="/oss.png"
                        alt="New Open Source & AI Tooling icon"
                        class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                    />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                    New Open Source & AI Tooling
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    New open source and tools built for the most ambitious Ruby
                    and Rails apps, including Ruby & AI.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-6"
            >
                <div class="w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                    <img
                        src="/scaleups.png"
                        alt="Ruby at Scale icon"
                        class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                    />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                    Ruby at Scale
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    Stories from Ruby startups that grew huge: how they scaled
                    their product and teams.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-6"
            >
                <div class="w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                    <img
                        src="/cto.png"
                        alt="CTO Panel icon"
                        class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                    />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">CTO Panel</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    Let's learn from the CTOs of multi-billion dollar Ruby
                    companies: Gusto, Chime, Clio, and more.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-200 p-6"
            >
                <div class="w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                    <img
                        src="/startups.png"
                        alt="Ruby Startup Demos icon"
                        class="w-full h-full object-contain"
                    />
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
                    Ruby Startup Demos
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                    Get inspired by the hottest products built with Ruby and
                    Rails today.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
